Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.07,0:00:02.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明与黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:03.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陷入一片混乱的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.93,0:00:06.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了四魂之玉因缘际会聚在一起的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:07.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越五百年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后仅存的四魂之玉碎片引导着各自的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:13.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:14.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.48,0:00:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生在深夜的神秘盗贼窃案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:19.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论是哪一家有钱人都无法幸免
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.25,0:00:21.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却没有人看得到犯人的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:24.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道真的是透明妖怪搞的鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:28.85,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:35.56,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a world （暧昧的世界） 奋力冲出吧{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.37,0:00:48.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对忧郁的现实生活{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.35,0:00:55.15,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在心中自我成长的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:01:01.49,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨夜的梦境及梦中残留的影像{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.36,0:01:06.35,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,断断续续提醒我「勇往直前」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:14.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破茧而出的我及含苞待放的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.37,0:01:18.83,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就将它禁锢起来吗{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:23.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:27.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go and try （不顾一切的去尝试） 无尽的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:32.34,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你天长地久永不分离
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.49,0:01:35.28,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you need to cry （同样的哭泣） 和孤独相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:39.78,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Show me a day fight （直接应战） 每当伤心流泪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.89,0:01:46.86,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它成为坚定不移的梦想吧{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.67,0:02:04.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落几乎快要找齐所有的四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.67,0:02:06.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得知这一点的我们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.37,0:02:09.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续寻找仅剩最后几块四魂之玉碎片的旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.45,0:02:13.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到在这段旅程中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.18,0:02:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们居然又再度遇到那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:18.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪退散
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:23.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚饭有些寒酸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:26.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么办法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:27.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在是抓不到鱼了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.80,0:02:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇的忍者食物已经吃完了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:30.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全没了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.97,0:02:31.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.87,0:02:34.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这次没有多买些储备的粮食啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.64,0:02:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算想买 荷包也不允许
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.27,0:02:38.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没有钱了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.77,0:02:39.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:42.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们得在这边赚点钱才行了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:52.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多烤好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:54.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么开动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:04.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的个子大 当然比较容易饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:07.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在发育的我才是最需要营养的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.77,0:03:09.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:11.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:15.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你赢得了我犬夜叉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.24,0:03:16.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.14,0:03:17.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.81,0:03:18.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:21.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:27.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢招待啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:34.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天就可以吃得饱饱了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:42.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉那个大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:44.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我记住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:47.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这顿饭的仇 总有一天我非报不可…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第136话 怪异的透明妖怪出现了出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:02.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就拜托您了 驱魔师婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:06.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心的交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.97,0:04:13.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么好像有一阵怪风
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.70,0:04:16.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 只是一般的风罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.90,0:04:18.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:20.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:25.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师婆婆 被…被偷走了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.71,0:04:29.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我疏忽了 今晚会是对面那一家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:39.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是个热闹的小镇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:41.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样不好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.50,0:04:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是要看能不能找到需要驱邪除魔的人家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:46.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正你都是搞些耍花样的骗人把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本没差吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:49.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话虽如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:52.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果人家看起来没有烦恼的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:53.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不可能这么好骗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:56.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么“不可能这么好骗”嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:58.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是什么光彩的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:01.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 照这么下去 好不容易到了小镇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:03.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却无法投宿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露宿在外就好啦 露宿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:07.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我想洗澡 也想睡在床上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:10.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也想吃好吃的对不对 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:11.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.13,0:05:16.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 要怎么办啊 你们不也是没办法嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:18.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:21.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久不见了 你们好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:22.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是那个驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.77,0:05:28.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:33.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是一点都没感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.55,0:05:34.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是了不起的驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:42.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来抓我呀 给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:43.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪退散
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.66,0:05:45.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:46.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.23,0:05:51.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个都给我住手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.73,0:05:55.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的人生历练还差的远呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.30,0:05:57.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你这个冒牌驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.01,0:06:00.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身为驱魔师的功夫如何 虽然不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:02.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过作为一个女人 好像还满厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:05.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是很担心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:09.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直在想弥勒法师跟公主相处得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢那个叫弥勒的法师是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:18.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看你 心事全都写在脸上了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:21.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经说过不是那样了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:25.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么 我可不管你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:30.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师婆婆 你的气色看起来不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:32.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:35.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天还精神弈弈的去驱魔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:38.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还在做驱魔师耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:40.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亏她到现在都还能平安无事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:43.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你们能来到这个小镇 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.98,0:06:45.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们来助我一臂之力好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.79,0:06:47.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你们来说只是小事嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:49.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么赚钱的好差事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:52.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一个人实在处理不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:55.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正准备找看看有没有帮手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:57.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那您就说来听听吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.70,0:06:59.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里晚上都会发生神秘事件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.87,0:07:05.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是以有钱人家为目标
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.14,0:07:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管门禁有多么森严
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.01,0:07:11.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后总是会被侵入 然后被偷走值钱的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.01,0:07:15.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过如果是盗贼的话 也不可能有这么不可思议的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.15,0:07:19.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以传说可能是妖怪所为
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.59,0:07:21.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可思议的本事是指什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:23.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管门户关得多紧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是会被盗贼从某处潜进去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.39,0:07:29.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然可以感觉到诡异的气息 可是就是看不到任何踪影
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:33.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个盗贼可以说是 既会穿墙又会隐身
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.33,0:07:34.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直就像忍者耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.84,0:07:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是忍者也做不到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:39.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 真的是完全透明的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:40.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,透明妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:41.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.84,0:07:45.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是人做的话 那就是妖怪搞的鬼了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:47.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:49.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依我猜测 敌人很有可能是用了妖术
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.35,0:07:51.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定可以揭穿他的妖术技俩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:52.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管看不看得见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:56.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要靠气味就可以逮住那个家伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.19,0:07:59.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉不是常常被妖术耍得团团转吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这小鬼也只会逃跑的技俩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.93,0:08:03.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.36,0:08:06.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也只是故意被那些愚蠢的妖术骗到罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.57,0:08:08.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个都给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:12.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:15.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个还在干什么 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:23.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是这个镇上的第二大户
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:27.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个镇上的第一有钱人跟第二有钱人家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:28.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都已经受害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:30.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这两户人家同时委托我处理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:33.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我打算要分成两组 分别同时监视两边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.56,0:08:36.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您说要分成两组 那要怎么分呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.90,0:08:39.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不要跟犬夜叉一组
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要你帮倒忙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:46.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉一定会中妖术出事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:47.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会用风之伤把这家伙一举消灭掉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.31,0:08:52.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.18,0:08:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先拥有法力的我跟弥勒法师 要分成两边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:08:59.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有法力的是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:02.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么珊瑚 驱魔师婆婆就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:03.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.06,0:09:08.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 另一个女孩就去那一组吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.56,0:09:10.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我加入弥勒法师这一边是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:14.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起那个婆婆 应该还是弥勒比较管用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:18.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起那个婆婆 还是弥勒看起来比较有用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:20.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是把犬夜叉放到那一组的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.67,0:09:22.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就没有人可以治得了他了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:24.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:26.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你就用你的妖术
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:28.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去协助驱魔师婆婆的法力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:30.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用我的妖术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:32.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算逃跑也没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.75,0:09:36.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会用我的妖术让可恶的盗贼现出原形
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:40.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这间屋子就交给弥勒法师你们几位了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.63,0:09:43.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去镇上第一有钱那边监视情况
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:45.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 就拜托各位了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:50.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:52.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正不管对方是不是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.14,0:09:54.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个家伙要等到晚上才会来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:55.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也只有等了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.98,0:09:59.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也可以趁机休息一下 做好准备吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.38,0:10:01.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以拜托他们让我洗个澡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:03.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你的便
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要说是为晚上作准备 对方应该不会不答应吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.65,0:10:09.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂时 就在这里轻松一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝他们不会有事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:18.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事就拜托各位帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:21.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么好像没什么精神
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:25.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为今天晚上可能还会有盗贼上门的缘故吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.81,0:10:27.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来要怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来想想计策吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.91,0:10:31.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,茶梗竖起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:33.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚或许会很顺利呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:34.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计策 什么计策啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.05,0:10:37.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你 你真的会妖术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:38.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:40.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以隐形吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:42.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:44.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我曾经听说过有这种妖术
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.03,0:10:48.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪可能会有透明的妖怪 我从来就没有听说过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.26,0:10:49.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:52.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我的身上倒是有能消除行迹的灵符
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也有能消除行迹的妖术喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:57.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然敌人能消失
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.84,0:11:00.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也消失的话 就可以打成平手了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:05.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要合起来试试吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:07.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对喔 试一试又不吃亏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术 云隐咒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.86,0:11:20.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 还差一点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.23,0:11:21.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.47,0:11:25.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:27.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:30.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.74,0:11:32.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全看不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 现在我又增加新的力量了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:39.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 在别人身上也试一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:42.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.95,0:11:45.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术 云隐咒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.36,0:11:50.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的云隐法术完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:53.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:58.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在制伏那个妖怪之前 我要先去完成一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:01.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会在傍晚之前回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.60,0:12:05.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事 跑掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:07.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…我也有点事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.98,0:12:09.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.85,0:12:14.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.02,0:12:16.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.25,0:12:17.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:19.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还给我 在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.49,0:12:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要拿回去的话 就原地转3圈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:27.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.73,0:12:30.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点还给她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.03,0:12:33.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫…猫说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:37.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.95,0:12:49.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.25,0:12:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:12:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢大姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:03.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好讨厌喔 法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:07.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不 我可是很认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:08.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.07,0:13:10.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:13.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.94,0:13:15.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说啊 说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们愿意为我生孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:19.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.48,0:13:22.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完…完了 被看到了不该看的了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:26.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么会找上我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:28.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.59,0:13:30.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们迷人的身段嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:31.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:33.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.23,0:13:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌 法师也真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:44.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:48.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是平常的话 她早就冲过来狠狠揍我了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.21,0:13:50.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 为什么沉默不语
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:52.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么沉默不语的跟在后面呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 她额头上的符咒是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:59.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是在讽刺我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:01.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:03.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了吗 突然不说话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:07.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为被你们两位漂亮的姑娘给夹在中间嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.63,0:14:08.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.53,0:14:12.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快一点 快点冲上来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:14.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么跟平常不一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:17.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人 这里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:18.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家店很好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:28.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请…请原谅我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:32.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要骂我的话 就痛痛快快的骂出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你看得见我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:37.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 你额头上的符咒是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.86,0:14:40.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你对我的讽刺对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.99,0:14:41.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:44.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:45.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看得见我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:49.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么 看得见看不见的啊 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:51.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.17,0:14:55.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才是…七宝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:36.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小鬼怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:15:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.01,0:16:01.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这小鬼对我做的事情好像让你觉得很乐嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.22,0:16:11.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝那小鬼 不知道是吃错了什么药
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.75,0:16:13.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狠狠地踹了我好几脚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.09,0:16:15.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就表示你们两个人感情很好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:17.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:21.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉和七宝就是因为感情好所以才会常常吵架呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.83,0:16:25.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了七宝他还小 你要手下留情喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:26.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不管他呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:30.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我太大意了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:33.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的鼻子很灵的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:35.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定是闻到了我的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:39.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们只能祈祷透明妖怪的鼻子不太灵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.05,0:16:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.38,0:16:43.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.99,0:16:47.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天就要黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:51.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家主人拜托我们保护他们的传家宝画轴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,画轴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,透明妖怪好像都是偷走书画和绸缎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:05.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 饭也吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澡也洗好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.31,0:17:09.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的就是等盗贼出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的会出现吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:13.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是不来的话怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.11,0:17:14.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:16.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要整夜不睡 看守在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.55,0:17:17.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:19.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你先去隔壁房间休息好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看我能撑到什么时候就撑到什么时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:24.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方也有可能不是来我们这边
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 盗贼会挑哪一家下手呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.33,0:17:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有感觉到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:33.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么特别的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.63,0:17:36.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我差点忘了 这个人就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 七宝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:41.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个小鬼把自己隐形 躲在屋子里了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算真的有妖怪侵入 也看不到他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.51,0:17:46.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.35,0:17:50.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:09.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 画轴被…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.16,0:19:12.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐火
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.91,0:19:22.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.21,0:19:25.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看得见我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:28.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:33.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 老婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.91,0:19:56.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙是怎么进到屋子里的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.94,0:19:58.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是透明的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.75,0:20:10.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交出来 把宝物交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.99,0:20:14.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:16.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是透明妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.73,0:20:18.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他并没有消失
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:20.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个妖怪在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.27,0:20:27.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的妖怪 在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.01,0:20:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把宝物交出来 在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.44,0:20:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:31.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.44,0:20:32.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.51,0:20:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛慌慌张张地乱窜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:36.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:38.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你好像在保护宝物嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.95,0:20:39.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.25,0:20:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:45.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.16,0:20:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还想逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:54.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.94,0:20:57.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不熟悉的气味就只有你一个了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:20:58.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.57,0:20:59.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.94,0:21:02.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情解决了 要怎么处置这个家伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:04.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:05.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依我看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.31,0:21:08.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让他把目前为止偷的东西都还回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.79,0:21:20.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我喜欢轻飘飘的东西 不知不觉就收集了这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好惊人的数量 我们干脆分赃算了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:25.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是要物归原主吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:27.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也好 即使那样也能得到不少酬劳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:31.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜我的新妖术 只差一点就能练成了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.34,0:21:32.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说你的新妖术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.91,0:21:35.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到最后 还是被犬夜叉救了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.51,0:21:36.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.88,0:21:40.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受到这次教训之后 你以后不要再接近村庄了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.81,0:21:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:46.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轻轻薄薄的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.89,0:21:49.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得看上去像是突然消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:21:52.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还真的以为是透明妖怪出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.73,0:21:53.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害我紧张个半死呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.06,0:21:56.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别说傻话了 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:57.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了什么傻话啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.73,0:22:00.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然是透明妖怪 怎么可能会现身呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:02.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:24.26,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今内心充满着悲伤的话{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.89,0:22:40.26,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管靠着我哭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:46.55,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.56,0:22:50.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the dreaming
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:55.85,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像现在这样{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.39,0:23:06.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come my way  这点黑暗之尘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.37,0:23:14.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come close to me  现在灯已照亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.54,0:23:17.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I'll be with you  I'll be with you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.94,0:23:22.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是简简单单的陪在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.31,0:23:28.76,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}So Come my way{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:53.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条家的秋时 遇到了很大的麻烦来找我们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.22,0:23:56.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是为了封印一把叫做乾坤之刀的妖刀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.72,0:23:58.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他不得不踏上旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.29,0:24:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是那个北条同学的祖先吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.09,0:24:03.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且现代的北条同学有一份好长的家谱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.50,0:24:05.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且里面竟然有我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.27,0:24:07.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该不会回不去现代
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.60,0:24:09.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留在战国时代嫁给了秋时吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.50,0:24:11.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.04,0:24:13.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祖先的名字叫做戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.97,0:24:16.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来又有一阵暴风雨了
